    // r14: the board's other new fields. `seasonPlays` (PZ-D05) names the season plays it uses (ids, ≤ 24);
    // `fromMesa` marks a scorer's copy made from la mesa (PZ-D22T); `fanToken` (the fan view's link,
    // PZ-D21F), `sevenKey` and `sevenRev` (the official seven's fingerprint and version, PZ-D01) are the
    // server's (functions/src/pizarraR14.ts): a client never sets them on create nor changes them on update
    // (boardCreateOk / boardUpdateOk), so their shape is the server's.
    // The seven: exactly seven slot maps (their content is validated on read, see lineupDoc.ts). (The server's
    // `sevenKey` is hashed past 900 characters — pizarraR14Logic.ts boardSevenKey — so it always fits.)
    // The other versions of the seven («2ª parte», «Plan B»): at most two maps, each with its own seven
    // slots (their content is validated on read, see lineupDoc.ts parseVariants).
    // La táctica (Bloque 4): «sin balón» (null, or its system and seven nudges) and the conditional plan
    // (≤ 3 rule maps of ≤ 8 keys). Their content is validated on read (lineupDoc.ts → tacticaData.ts).
    // The board's tags («Liga», «Copa», «Entreno»): at most three texts of 1–20 (joined and split back: the same
    // list, so every item is a string; see v2/tags.ts).
    // Every key a board may have. (`bench` and `pinned` are no longer written, but older boards still carry them.)
    function boardKeys() {
      return ['formation','freeMode','slots','bench','roles','tactics','playerPositions','pinned',
          'variants','subs','takers','drawings','plays','ownerUid','ownerNickname','seasonId','name','isOfficial','matchId',
