    // Drawings (≤ 60) and jugadas (≤ 12) — each stroke, play and step (with r14's `dur`, `key` and drawings `d`)
    // is validated on read (drawings.ts, plays.ts) —, the season plays used (≤ 24) and the tags (≤ 3 texts of 1–20:
    // joined and split back, the same list, so every item is a string; see v2/tags.ts).
    function boardExtrasOk(d) {
      return d.get('drawings', []) is list && d.get('drawings', []).size() <= 60
        && d.get('plays', []) is list && d.get('plays', []).size() <= 12
        && d.get('seasonPlays', []).size() <= 24
        && d.get('tags', []).size() <= 3
        && (d.get('tags', []).size() == 0
          || (d.tags.join('¬').matches('[^¬]{1,20}(¬[^¬]{1,20}){0,2}') && d.tags.join('¬').split('¬') == d.tags));
    }
    // La táctica: «sin balón» (null, or its system and seven nudges), the conditional plan (≤ 3 rule maps of ≤ 8
    // keys), the other versions («2ª parte», «Plan B»: ≤ 2, each seven slots, a name ≤ 24, ≤ 12 consignas) and the
    // rival (null, or their system, ≤ 7 players; r14 PZ-D21P: `visible`, and `danger` = the index of their danger
